Third-party data bundled with the app
-------------------------------------

Israel aviation data (efb-212/Resources/israel-aviation.sqlite)
  Aeronautical data: Civil Aviation Authority of Israel (CAAI), data of 25 Oct 2026
  GIS layers published with the Israeli domestic AIP (https://www.gov.il/he/pages/aip?chapterIndex=11),
  redistributed with CAAI's approval: CVFR reporting points and routes, CTR/ATZ/CTA, TMA, FIR,
  prohibited/restricted/danger areas, runways. Built by tools/caai-importer.
  This approval covers the GIS layers only. The official CVFR chart is not licensed and is not included.
  The data is for reference; the binding publications are CAAI's official AIP and NOTAMs.

US aviation data (efb-212/Resources/aviation.sqlite)
  FAA National Airspace System Resources (NASR), built by tools/nasr-importer.
